Hi

When being polymorphed into a vampire or demons, the player doesn't
write on the floor but scrawls:
"You scrawl on the floor with your fingers."

The resulting message is "scrawled in blood".

From reading the source (engrave.c:320) I know this is a reference to
Thriller.


But even when writing on the floor with a soft object, the message is
still "scrawled in blood". Is this intentional?

"You scrawl on the floor with a blindfold."
"What do you want to scrawl on the floor here?"
"You see a message scrawled in blood here."


I don't know about you people, but I have trouble imagining how that
should work.

